ex:TK8_BuildPage_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Page 9.97.2 (03-materials/ch19/page/sen0414_ch19_page_v9_97_2.html, template 9.53.5) replaces 9.97.1: the Stories tab no longer prints the WHO/WHERE/WHEN labels, the Oxigraph double-start crash is fixed, and the research A-box 1.0.8 (maker 1.2.0, 08-tooling/ch19-page/abox_lambda_free_make_v1_2_0.py) writes every err and warned text as a small def, so no eval and no lambda is left. The maker still reports 7 examples whose result differs from the original in this environment (5 need a missing program or package, 2 depend on the Python version); the old maker 1.1.0 reports the same 7 here, so this change adds none; the page data was recorded with the interpreter that has the schedule package." .
ex:TK8_BuildVerify_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch19-page/logs_v9_97_2: page test 9.39.0 (unchanged) ran to the end: 412 features passed, 0 failed, including phone and tablet layouts; material check 8 of 8 pass; manifest self-check pass; story layout 19 of 19 pass. STILL NOT VERIFIED: the verification is by the same agent that built the material (not independent); the reviewed conditions are not recorded; the declared deck-standard measure (check 1.0.0) contradicts the 2026-11-14 rulings and is not met; links not re-opened in this session." .
ex:ST8_BuildCh19 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck 2.2.0 and page 9.97.2 with their checks done; the open points are listed on the verify task." .
